+
+**Exact location:** `spec-pack/quality-charter.md` §1 A1.2, §3 A3.2/A3.4–A3.6, §4 G1–G5 and A4.1–A4.5, §5 A5.1–A5.5; compare §7 VR-1–VR-4 and DR-047.
